==== WeightWet ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for clothes. Sets the weight when clothes are wet. (The game dynamically calculates the weight depending on how wet the clothes are)
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
WeightWet = 1.5,
</syntaxhighlight>
